#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/jobs.rst:120
msgid ""
"|morpheus| tracks Jobs internally as ``JobTemplate`` records linked to "
"their parent cluster (``ComputeServerGroup``). Each Job template stores:"
msgstr "O |morpheus| rastreia Jobs internamente como registros ``JobTemplate`` vinculados ao cluster pai (``ComputeServerGroup``). Cada modelo de Job armazena:"

